# 反例：把超胞（原子构型，Data 一侧）填进 hasSimulatedMaterial。
# 一个只标了 AtomicConfiguration；另一个同时被误标为 emmo:Material（sh:not Data 那一半）。
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix emmo: <https://w3id.org/emmo#> .
@prefix commagmo: <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/commagmo#> .
@prefix ex: <https://example.org/commagmo-test#> .

ex:supercell a commagmo:AtomicConfiguration .
ex:supercell2 a commagmo:AtomicConfiguration , emmo:EMMO_4207e895_8b83_4318_996a_72cfb32acd94 .
ex:dft1 a commagmo:DFTSimulation ; commagmo:hasSimulatedMaterial ex:supercell .
ex:dft2 a commagmo:DFTSimulation ; commagmo:hasSimulatedMaterial ex:supercell2 .
